@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# UniDex multibase binary-v1
+
+The handoff binary-v1 implementation is built into libsgl_kernel_npu.so by:
+
+```bash
+bash build.sh -a kernels Ascend910_9382
+python3 -m pip install --force-reinstall --no-deps output/sgl_kernel_npu-*.whl
+```
+
+Import sgl_kernel_npu, then call torch.ops.npu.unidex_copy_multibase.
+The schema takes src_bases, src_ranges, src_base_valid, dst_bases,
+dst_ranges, dst_base_valid, src_index, dst_index, valid_mask,
+block_bytes, block_dim (default 8). Metadata tensors remain owned by the
+caller for the lifetime of captured graphs. Existing unidex_copy stays intact.
+
+Host and device sources are unchanged from the ticket26 standalone plugin.
+source-identity.json records their handoff provenance. Hardware compilation
+and Graph / remote visibility acceptance remain pending.
